reen allow=autoplay></iframe></div><script src="https://player.vimeo.com/api/player.js"></script></div></div></div></div><div class="horizontal-tabs-menu w-tab-menu"><a data-w-tab="Tab 3" class="horizontal-tab-link w-inline-block w-tab-link w--current"><div class="horizontal-tabs-video mobile-visible"><div class="horizontal-tab-video-wrapper w-embed w-iframe w-script"><div style="padding:46.9% 0 0 0;position:relative;"><iframe src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/410518157?title=0" style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;" frameborder="0" allow="autoplay; fullscreen" allowfullscreen allow=autoplay></iframe></div><script src="https://player.vimeo.com/api/player.js"></script></div></div><div class="horizontal-tab-head"><div class="horizontal-tab-head-icon"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea05a6c9816bb303c5cb6ed_arrow-up%201.svg" alt="" loading="lazy" class="horizontal-tab-icon grey"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea05a6c26dc303956184a6d_arrow-up%202.svg" alt="" class="horizontal-tab-icon blue"/></div><h3 class="horizontal-tab-title">Drag ’n drop Upload</h3></div><div class="horizontal-tab-divider"></div><p class="horizontal-tab-p">Effortlessly bulk upload documents and folders. Auto indexing keeps everything organized and easy to find.</p></a><a data-w-tab="Tab 4" class="horizontal-tab-link w-inline-block w-tab-link"><div class="horizontal-tabs-video mobile-visible"><div class="horizontal-tab-video-wrapper w-embed w-iframe w-script"><div style="padding:46.9% 0 0 0;position:relative;"><iframe src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/410518140?title=0" style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%" frameborder="0" allow="autoplay; fullscreen" allowfullscreen allow=autoplay></iframe></div><script src="https://player.vimeo.com/api/player.js"></script></div></div><div class="horizontal-tab-head"><div class="horizontal-tab-head-icon"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea05729f1d809728e9ba608_shield-gr.svg" alt="" loading="lazy" class="horizontal-tab-icon grey"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea057299816bb85ce5c28f0_shield-bl.svg" alt="" class="horizontal-tab-icon blue"/></div><h3 class="horizontal-tab-title">4-level permissions</h3></div><div class="horizontal-tab-divider"></div><p class="horizontal-tab-p">Easily apply watermarks, and restrict viewing, downloading, and printing.</p></a><a data-w-tab="Tab 5" class="horizontal-tab-link w-inline-block w-tab-link"><div class="horizontal-tabs-video mobile-visible"><div class="horizontal-tab-video-wrapper w-embed w-iframe w-script"><div style="padding:46.9% 0 0 0;position:relative;"><iframe src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/410518121?title=0" style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;" frameborder="0" allow="autoplay; fullscreen" allowfullscreen allow=autoplay></iframe></div><script src="https://player.vimeo.com/api/player.js"></script></div></div><div class="horizontal-tab-head"><div class="horizontal-tab-head-icon"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea05a6c13c940ff7ef7ba36_search-sharp%202.svg" alt="" loading="lazy" class="horizontal-tab-icon grey"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea05a6df1c0f4eff780f5ae_search-sharp%201.svg" alt="" class="horizontal-tab-icon blue"/></div><h3 class="horizontal-tab-title">Full text search</h3></div><div class="horizontal-tab-divider"></div><p class="horizontal-tab-p">Quickly find the information or document you need by searching keywords or phrases.</p></a></div></div></div></div><div class="section"><div class="container"><div data-duration-in="300" data-duration-out="100" data-current="Tab 1" data-easing="ease" class="contrast-tabs w-tabs"><div class="contrast-tabs-content w-tab-content"><div data-w-tab="Tab 1" class="contrast-tab-pane w-tab-pane w--tab-active"><div class="contrast-tab-content"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea1b216fdc0b2269ed2f10e_group-835%402x-3.avif" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea1b216fdc0b2269ed2f10e_group-835%402x-3-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea1b216fdc0b2269ed2f10e_group-835%402x-3.avif 1262w" loading="lazy" alt="" class="contrast-tab-img"/></div></div><div data-w-tab="Tab 2" class="contrast-tab-pane w-tab-pane"><div class="contrast-tab-content"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea2c8b848ebd52388332a77_group-838%402x-3.webp" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea2c8b848ebd52388332a77_group-838%402x-3-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea2c8b848ebd52388332a77_group-838%402x-3.webp 1220w" loading="lazy" alt="" class="contrast-tab-img"/></div></div><div data-w-tab="Tab 3" class="contrast-tab-pane w-tab-pane"><div class="contrast-tab-content"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea2c8373e29080c09918bb8_group-839%402x-3.avif" alt="" loading="lazy" class="contrast-tab-img"/></div></div></div><div class="contrast-tabs-menu w-tab-menu"><a data-w-tab="Tab 1" class="contrast-tab-link w-inline-block w-tab-link w--current"><div class="contrast-tab-content mobile-visible"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea1b216fdc0b2269ed2f10e_group-835%402x-3.avif" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea1b216fdc0b2269ed2f10e_group-835%402x-3-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea1b216fdc0b2269ed2f10e_group-835%402x-3.avif 1262w" alt="" class="contrast-tab-img"/></div><h3 class="contrast-tab-title">Manage multiple deals <br/>simultaneously</h3><p class="contrast-tabs-p">Access an overview of multiple deals including revenue, business unit, business type, employee count, and more.</p><div class="contrast-tab-color-wrapper"><div class="contrast-color"></div></div></a><a data-w-tab="Tab 2" class="contrast-tab-link w-inline-block w-tab-link"><div class="contrast-tab-content mobile-visible"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea2c8b848ebd52388332a77_group-838%402x-3.webp" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea2c8b848ebd52388332a77_group-838%402x-3-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea2c8b848ebd52388332a77_group-838%402x-3.webp 1220w" alt="" class="contrast-tab-img"/></div><h3 class="contrast-tab-title">Access and manage key member information</h3><p class="contrast-tabs-p">Keep all your contacts information and team members all in one place.</p><div class="contrast-tab-color-wrapper"><div class="contrast-color"></div></div></a><a data-w-tab="Tab 3" class="contrast-tab-link w-inline-block w-tab-link"><div class="contrast-tab-content mobile-visible"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea2c8373e29080c09918bb8_group-839%402x-3.avif" alt="" class="contrast-tab-img"/></div><h3 class="contrast-tab-title">Preview deals from the timeline view</h3><p class="contrast-tabs-p">Visually see your deals and how they compare on a timeline. Quicky see deal lengths, start dates, end dates, and more.</p><div class="contrast-tab-color-wrapper"><div class="contrast-color"></div></div></a></div></div></div></div><div class="section-reporting"><div class="background-color-primary"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xlarge"><div class="layout6_component"><div class="layout6_image-layout"><div class="layout6_image-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/62cbe2a933c6502da7d02c98_s%20(1).avif" loading="lazy" width="678" height="570" alt="" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/62cbe2a933c6502da7d02c98_s%20(1)-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/62cbe2a933c6502da7d02c98_s%20(1).avif 1356w" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 678px" class="layout6_image-image"/></div></div><div class="layout6_layout"><div class="page-padding"><div class="layout6_content"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xsmall"><div class="text-color-light3">Featured resource</div></div><h2 class="heading-xxlarge">BI Reporting</h2><div class="margin-top margin-xsmall"><div class="text-size-large">Get real-time insight into the state of your team’s work and everything you need to take action—without leaving DealRoom.</div></div><div dr-lead-button-click="BI Reporting CTA Section" class="margin-top margin-medium"><a href="/product/request-a-demo" class="button is-white w-button">Book a demo</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="sections-divider"></div><div class="section fullpage-video-section"><div class="container fullpage-video-intro"><div class="intro mw800"><h2 class="medium-heading">Streamline diligence management and communication</h2><div class="product-subtitle">Eliminate Excel trackers, emails, disconnected tools and frequent meetings from the diligence process.</div></div></div><div class="video-negative-margin"><div class="fullpage-video-embed negative-margin w-embed w-iframe w-script"><div style="padding:62.45% 0 0 0;position:relative;"><iframe src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/410524619?background=1" style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;" frameborder="0" allow="autoplay; fullscreen" allowfullscreen allow=autoplay></iframe></div><script src="https://player.vimeo.com/api/player.js"></script></div></div></div><div class="section"><div class="container"><div data-duration-in="300" data-duration-out="100" data-current="Tab 1" data-easing="ease" class="contrast-tabs w-tabs"><div class="contrast-tabs-menu vertical w-tab-menu"><a data-w-tab="Tab 1" class="contrast-tab-link w-inline-block w-tab-link w--current"><div class="contrast-tab-content no-shadow mobile-visible"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea1a0f3387d0839c8a6fb7b_group-836%402x-2.avif" width="491" alt="" class="contrast-tab-img"/></div><h3 class="contrast-tab-title">Plan integration easily</h3><p class="contrast-tabs-p">Be ready to execute your post-merger integration plan on Day 1.</p><div class="contrast-tab-color-wrapper"><div class="contrast-color ocean"></div></div></a><a data-w-tab="Tab 2" class="contrast-tab-link w-inline-block w-tab-link"><div class="contrast-tab-content no-shadow mobile-visible"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea6e9d04964fb4c765e1fe3_group-799%402x-2.avif" width="491" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 491px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea6e9d04964fb4c765e1fe3_group-799%402x-2-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea6e9d04964fb4c765e1fe3_group-799%402x-2.avif 1132w" alt="" class="contrast-tab-img"/></div><h3 class="contrast-tab-title">Keep teams aligned to realize all value opportunities</h3><p class="contrast-tabs-p">Ensure that everyone knows timelines, tasks, and dependencies.</p><div class="contrast-tab-color-wrapper"><div class="contrast-color ocean"></div></div></a><a data-w-tab="Tab 3" class="contrast-tab-link w-inline-block w-tab-link"><div class="contrast-tab-content no-shadow mobile-visible"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea6e9cf4964fb9d5e5e1fe2_group-841%402x-2.webp" width="491" alt="" class="contrast-tab-img"/></div><h3 class="contrast-tab-title">Track integration progress</h3><p class="contrast-tabs-p">Be confident that you and all stakeholders are constantly in the know of integration progress and priorities.</p><div class="contrast-tab-color-wrapper"><div class="contrast-color ocean"></div></div></a></div><div class="contrast-tabs-content w-tab-content"><div data-w-tab="Tab 1" class="contrast-tab-pane w-tab-pane w--tab-active"><div class="contrast-tab-content no-shadow pt60"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea1a0f3387d0839c8a6fb7b_group-836%402x-2.avif" width="491" alt="" loading="lazy" class="contrast-tab-img"/></div></div><div data-w-tab="Tab 2" class="contrast-tab-pane w-tab-pane"><div class="contrast-tab-content no-shadow pt60"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea6e9d04964fb4c765e1fe3_group-799%402x-2.avif" width="491" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 491px" loading="lazy" alt="" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea6e9d04964fb4c765e1fe3_group-799%402x-2-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea6e9d04964fb4c765e1fe3_group-799%402x-2.avif 1132w" class="contrast-tab-img"/></div></div><div data-w-tab="Tab 3" class="contrast-tab-pane vertical w-tab-pane"><div class="contrast-tab-content no-shadow pt60"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea6e9cf4964fb9d5e5e1fe2_group-841%402x-2.webp" width="491" alt="" loading="lazy" class="contrast-tab-img"/></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section no-pt-mobile"><div class="container"><div data-duration-in="300" data-duration-out="100" data-current="Tab 1" data-easing="ease" class="contrast-tabs w-tabs"><div class="contrast-tabs-content w-tab-content"><div data-w-tab="Tab 1" class="contrast-tab-pane vertical w-tab-pane w--tab-active"><div class="contrast-tab-content no-shadow"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea1a4314c89878cdab9368c_group-757%402x-2.avif" width="491" alt="" loading="lazy" class="contrast-tab-img"/></div></div><div data-w-tab="Tab 2" class="contrast-tab-pane vertical w-tab-pane"><div class="contrast-tab-content no-shadow pt60"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5eaab8835bf2474b3a6c062f_activity%402x-3.avif" width="491" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 491px" loading="lazy" alt="" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5eaab8835bf2474b3a6c062f_activity%402x-3-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5eaab8835bf2474b3a6c062f_activity%402x-3.avif 1058w" class="contrast-tab-img"/></div></div><div data-w-tab="Tab 3" class="contrast-tab-pane vertical w-tab-pane"><div class="contrast-tab-content no-shadow"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5eaab883be49fee9a7f5b7d5_group-756%402x-4.webp" width="491" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 491px" loading="lazy" alt="" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5eaab883be49fee9a7f5b7d5_group-756%402x-4-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5eaab883be49fee9a7f5b7d5_group-756%402x-4.webp 922w" class="contrast-tab-img"/></div></div></div><div class="contrast-tabs-menu vertical w-tab-menu"><a data-w-tab="Tab 1" class="contrast-tab-link w-inline-block w-tab-link w--current"><div class="contrast-tab-content no-shadow mobile-visible vertical-image-inside"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea1a4314c89878cdab9368c_group-757%402x-2.avif" width="491" alt="" class="contrast-tab-img"/></div><h3 class="contrast-tab-title">Track diligence progress</h3><p class="contrast-tabs-p">Track the progress of requests over time and monitor requests flagged as high risk or priority.</p><div class="contrast-tab-color-wrapper"><div class="contrast-color ocean"></div></div></a><a data-w-tab="Tab 2" class="contrast-tab-link w-inline-block w-tab-link"><div class="contrast-tab-content no-shadow mobile-visible vertical-image-inside"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea1a57091965b44b2ff7634_activity%402x-2.webp" width="491" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 491px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea1a57091965b44b2ff7634_activity%402x-2-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea1a57091965b44b2ff7634_activity%402x-2.webp 1058w" alt="" class="contrast-tab-img"/></div><h3 class="contrast-tab-title">Review documents activity</h3><p class="contrast-tabs-p">See who viewed what documents and when, as well as who downloaded and uploaded files.</p><div class="contrast-tab-color-wrapper"><div class="contrast-color ocean"></div></div></a><a data-w-tab="Tab 3" class="contrast-tab-link w-inline-block w-tab-link"><div class="contrast-tab-content no-shadow mobile-visible vertical-image-inside"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea6e3f7789969515ad722d0_group-756%402x-3.webp" width="491" alt="" class="contrast-tab-img"/></div><h3 class="contrast-tab-title">Investigate buyers engagement</h3><p class="contrast-tabs-p">See which buyer is spending the most time reviewing specific diligence requests to get a better idea of their engagement level.</p><div class="contrast-tab-color-wrapper"><div class="contrast-color ocean"></div></div></a></div></div></div></div><div class="section integrations-intro-section"><div class="container"><div class="intro mw900"><h2 class="medium-heading">Integrations</h2><div class="product-subtitle">DealRoom can integrate with modern and useful M&amp;A tools to further create a central hub for collaboration and management across your deals. Get rid of information silos and simplify your M&amp;A process.</div></div></div></div><div class="section integration-section"><div class="container"><div class="w-layout-grid integrations-grid"><div class="integrations-box"><div class="integrations-logo-box"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea1ab68313c641c64efd4c2_image-24%402x-2.avif" alt="" loading="lazy" class="integrations-logo-img"/></div><p class="integrations-box-p">Push room notifications to designated slack channels.</p><div class="integrations-box-indicator"></div></div><div class="integrations-box"><div class="integrations-logo-box"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea1ab62f0531e0725a9004d_image-25%402x-2.png" alt="" loading="lazy" class="integrations-logo-img sf"/></div><p class="integrations-box-p">Import and export contacts and team members right from your organization.</p><div class="integrations-box-indicator"></div></div><div class="integrations-box"><div class="integrations-logo-box"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea9e0571dc390ed443d04db_ms%20teams%20(2).webp" alt="" loading="lazy" class="integrations-logo-img _365"/></div><p class="integrations-box-p">Push notifications to the channel linking back to DealRoom.</p><div class="integrations-box-indicator"></div></div><div class="integrations-box"><div class="integrations-logo-box"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea1ab684a795dd2a5e9a704_image-32%402x-2.avif" alt="" loading="lazy" class="integrations-logo-img idaptive"/></div><p class="integrations-box-p">Cover your single-sign-on needs across all apps including DealRoom.</p><div class="integrations-box-indicator"></div></div><div class="integrations-box"><div class="integrations-logo-box"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea9df4a33208ddf65ac437b_Okta_Logo_BrightBlue_Medium%20(1).avif" alt="" loading="lazy" class="integrations-logo-img"/></div><p class="integrations-box-p">Manage access across your applications and DealRoom.</p><div class="integrations-box-indicator"></div></div><div class="integrations-box"><div class="integrations-logo-box"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea1ab68bd4a5a654a999b99_image-34%402x-2.avif" alt="" loading="lazy" class="integrations-logo-img g"/></div><p class="integrations-box-p">Access Google apps and DealRoom directly without a second sign-in.</p><div class="integrations-box-indicator"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section p100-80"><div class="container"><div class="templates-cta-flex"><div class="templates-cta-content"><h2 class="medium-heading">Pre-built templates</h2><p class="product-subtitle templates">Speed up your process with DealRoom’s library of pre-made templates that ranges from due diligence, form of LOI, flows of funds, to integration and more.</p></div><div class="templates-cta-image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea2a83a855877bb0dd1147d_s-13.webp" width="590" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 590px" loading="lazy" alt="" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea2a83a855877bb0dd1147d_s-13-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea2a83a855877bb0dd1147d_s-13.webp 1180w" class="templates-cta-img"/><a href="/resources/templates" class="button arrow-button w-inline-block"><div>View Templates</div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea2a8f23e290840ac90b868_arrow-right%202.svg" width="16" alt="" class="button-arrow-icon ml16"/></a></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea2b503329199489b989019_group-1446.svg" alt="" loading="lazy" class="templates-cta-bg-img left-top"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5a71001fb54d350001949400/5ea2b8a58558771df9d1779c_5ea1af35fdc0b24a9bd2dfcc_left-medium-int%201-2.png" alt="" loading="lazy" class="templates-cta-bg-img bottom-right"/></div></div></div><div class="section footer-cta"><div class="container"><div class="footer-cta-flex"><h2 class="medium-heading footer-cta-title">Ready to get started?</h2><div class="footer-cta-buttons-flex"><div class="footer-cta-button-wrapper"><a dr-lead-button-click="Footer CTA Primary Button" href="/product/request-a-demo" class="button footer-cta-button w-button">Yes, let&#x27;s talk!</a></div></div></div></div></div><footer data-wf--footer--variant="base" class="fo